## Title: Travel Wheel
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.5.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## Description: Everything about travelling fast. Wheel entries (LibRadialMenu) for wayshrines, any house inside or outside, Cyrodiil, Imperial City and battleground queues. Takes you back where you were after a battleground, campaign or dungeon. Accepts ready queues at once or after a wait.
## SavedVariables: TravelWheelSavedVars
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings LibRadialMenu
## OptionalDependsOn: LibConsoleLogger
## DevId: a981c79d-3b39-400d-94d1-e164bdd88393

